---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContextAlert from '../components/ContextAlert.astro';
import Markdown from '../components/Markdown.astro';

const explainer = `
NetSentinel is a cloud-based anomaly detection system that monitors real-time network traffic to identify potential security threats. By leveraging Netlify’s advanced features—such as [Streaming SSR](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/server-side-rendering/#html-streaming), [Edge Middleware](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/middleware/), and [on-demand revalidation](https://www.netlify.com/blog/cache-tags-and-purge-api-on-netlify/)—NetSentinel can continuously update its analytics dashboards without impacting site performance.

Our solution uses an unsupervised learning model (Isolation Forest) to spot suspicious network patterns like DDoS attempts or insider threats. The on-demand build and caching techniques ensure that your visitors always receive fast, secure pages, while the underlying anomaly detection engine works behind the scenes to keep your environment safe.
`;
---

<Layout title="Welcome to NetSentinel">
    <ContextAlert class="mb-8" />
    <h1 class="mb-10">NetSentinel - Cloud-based Anomaly Detection</h1>
    <Markdown content={explainer} class="mb-10 text-lg" />
    <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/YourUser/NetSentinel" class="btn btn-lg sm:min-w-64">View on GitHub</a>
    </p>
</Layout>
